{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:708","content":{"id":708,"title":"子集","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"0bbf41c4-0ed0-4980-8761-ef512c8524d2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"子集"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"26c06314-a096-4da7-9b0a-b298d295eb27","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"23761044-785c-4f35-bd42-ef1ab6f25e2a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给你一个整数数组 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nums"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，数组中的元素互不相同 。返回该数组所有可能的子集(幂集)。解集不能包含重复的子集。你可以按 任意顺序 返回解集。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f6aebd06-8530-4a07-a98f-279841205692","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例 1："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"9b6d8a16-a844-4610-bc55-7de6b2e0d77d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"06eb21a8-4cc9-4981-88cf-ea1bd3d54f2f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：nums = [1,2,3]\n输出：[[],[1],[2],[1,2],[3],[1,3],[2,3],[1,2,3]]","collabId":"18cc00f0-bc3b-4774-999c-299d01bad3c5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ca715e06-4125-45f5-8777-ffbad328c972","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例 2："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"216ca916-c013-404c-84f7-1fa877bf6107","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"daf99022-e06d-4701-92e9-e8abfce8b42b","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：nums = [0]\n输出：[[],[0]]","collabId":"ab77f0e6-4f30-4a96-83f2-5a30e9cba875","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"5bf66cb3-500e-4a46-801d-8da7cf991e2d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"014b652e-0052-4e96-93d0-983a2139327e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"将输入的数组看做是一棵树，每一个节点的孩子都包含所有的元素，树的层级就是元素的个数，以数组 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"[1, 2, 3]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为例，其树的形状为"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_03f016c9-3d9f-454f-aff2-9ebff72df927.webp","uuid":"33d6628f-601e-4b61-ac63-dcb8854a1e64","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_03f016c9-3d9f-454f-aff2-9ebff72df927.webp","width":720,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"927e40cb-83ff-44b8-ba48-ba0527dc991e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"817fe839-4f92-46e9-b173-81015bf5ab63","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"从根节点开始进行深度优先遍历，我们使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"path"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来保存从根节点到当前节点的路径，当来到一个节点时，我们将该节点添加到路径 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"path"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中，并且将此时的路径可作为一个子集，而回到父节点时，将该节点从 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"path"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中移除。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"33606810-d2fa-480c-a2b9-1868e9afa46f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在遍历的过程中需要注意不能重复访问"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0321ccf3-8a73-4df8-a8fb-f8cc49ba6174.webp","uuid":"69b7a315-d02c-4a55-a084-63e88e7bbdbc","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0321ccf3-8a73-4df8-a8fb-f8cc49ba6174.webp","width":720,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"8b356536-3275-48a5-ac3b-d12e38e3b4b8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"86e835d1-b367-4b87-982b-eea02d3d5303","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面我们从根节点来到了节点 1，从节点继续深度优先遍历，此时因为节点 1 以及访问过了，所以下面以节点 1 起始的子树不能重复访问。除此之外，当我们从遍历完以节点 1 开始的的这个子树时，所有包含节点 1 的子集全部都被考虑了"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_d1b645b5-5fba-4ed4-976e-d4fd0b59dc99.webp","uuid":"33cfc85b-efcb-4f41-8870-57c0f2dccc39","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_d1b645b5-5fba-4ed4-976e-d4fd0b59dc99.webp","width":720,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"c9159207-3aaa-40c7-84db-cc48c188a841","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"675373e3-19ce-48f2-8d70-992be88bdcbe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以当我们来到节点 2 时，不能访问它所包含的 1 节点"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_871be69f-bc52-4716-a765-5b6b7f65c6a7.webp","uuid":"99188f29-4845-4fce-be09-36da5b108867","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_871be69f-bc52-4716-a765-5b6b7f65c6a7.webp","width":720,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"9b7552c9-8fac-40aa-9e90-2ec5069eefab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"a2cdf196-a3ba-4107-9f03-6f69f8f2d21d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"4257e14b-41a4-462e-b39a-3be3a4facc80","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"private List<List<Integer>> res = new ArrayList<>();\nprivate int[] nums;\npublic List<List<Integer>> subsets(int[] nums) {\n    this.nums = nums;\n    res.add(new ArrayList<>());\n\n    for (int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {\n        // 从节点 nums[i] 开始遍历\n        combine(i, new ArrayList<>());\n    }\n\n    return res;\n}\n\nprivate void combine(int i, ArrayList<Integer> path) {\n    path.add(nums[i]);\n    res.add(path);\n\n    for (int k = i + 1; k < nums.length; k++) {\n        combine(k, new ArrayList<>(path));\n    }\n}","collabId":"aa957421-aa8f-46b5-9f07-586329047fbe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"1720a21f-2531-4d04-8c5b-b9a3c09ca764","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"子集II"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"098759e7-c629-4d1b-b164-c8a8b3e07ccc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5b604346-9467-43c2-9371-2b5cb428360e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给你一个整数数组 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nums"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，其中可能包含重复元素，请你返回该数组所有可能的子集(幂集)。解集不能包含重复的子集。返回的解集中，子集可以按任意顺序排列。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f95a34e8-e588-42b2-9595-aa4d751e39fc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例1："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"03f9b066-1e8e-46fc-9a73-98dcb091caae","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1c85d9f5-7678-448f-8d99-68171f1fad38","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：nums = [1,2,2]\n输出：[[],[1],[1,2],[1,2,2],[2],[2,2]]","collabId":"d74ba6ba-1177-4a43-a9a8-059ace1dd56f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"74c877b2-eb52-4912-966b-b55a00101e95","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例2："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"b078322d-e104-431c-affb-ae90b4cc536c","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f55efb64-b153-4fc2-b39b-a43e65beb85d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：nums = [0]\n输出：[[],[0]]","collabId":"5035e9b4-bcb8-4237-ade8-5a5f5679b1b4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"95038eed-56f7-4062-b917-bd2701148b19","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"544d6367-e6a9-403f-9c04-5c6e4d3c2730","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"总体的解决思路同上，但是有个变化就是数组中可能有重复的元素，这个时候我们一般需要对数组进行排序，当我们进入下一层节点时不能重复添加，所以我们会判断当前元素是否与前一个元素相同，如果相同，则不添加该元素"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"127e1f45-65b6-42c0-8d88-c62a2ddab58d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"a79f81b7-242b-4de0-92b9-4d22474ca986","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"private List<List<Integer>> res = new ArrayList<>();\nprivate int[] nums;\npublic List<List<Integer>> subsetsWithDup(int[] nums) {\n    // 排序\n    Arrays.sort(nums);\n    this.nums = nums;\n    res.add(new ArrayList<>());\n\n    for (int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {\n        if (i == 0 || nums[i - 1] != nums[i]) {\n            combine(i, new ArrayList<>());\n        }\n    }\n\n    return res;\n}\n\nprivate void combine(int i, List<Integer> path) {\n    path.add(nums[i]);\n    res.add(path);\n\n    for (int k = i + 1; k < nums.length; k++) {\n        // 判断，如果当前元素与前一个元素相同，则忽略\n        if (k == i + 1 || nums[k] != nums[k - 1]) {\n            combine(k, new ArrayList<>(path));\n        }\n    }\n}","collabId":"58f04adb-f811-485c-b2fd-c3586171f51c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"ade298d2-0bd9-4e19-8739-6fa26c8b53c0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"d072ae57-fccc-4f2a-93ba-898d9123e21f","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"239de551-c881-49a3-a105-b5c34b796890","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2ce88618-e3e7-44f2-9af5-99c118940349","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/subsets/","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"4f109554-abec-4ff4-b205-522b44c9d459","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"子集"}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ff33d7aa-4084-4c41-8ed6-1e413761ebfb","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bb8be50c-5c3c-447b-b1ca-e8f1a84382c4","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/subsets-ii/","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"6a8fbf5b-84dc-4f01-be29-4fb7ada0e9d8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"子集II"}]}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"深度优先遍历"},{"label":"子集","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:708","type":"doc","id":708}}],"prevPage":{"title":"全排列","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:698","type":"doc","id":698}},"nextPage":{"title":"组合","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:709","type":"doc","id":709}},"createTime":1729002166738,"updateTime":1775929170699,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1775929170699}}